This directory contains 1,512 canonical icons in six weights: thin, light,
regular, bold, fill, and duotone (9,072 SVG variants). The upstream assets/
SVG files are stored without artwork changes in compact JSON shards of up to
128 icons, ordered by the Phosphor entries in asgard-symbols-data.js. Each
weight has 12 shards (11 of 128 icons and one of 104), for 72 shipped files.
No upstream alias is duplicated as a second catalog entry.

asgard-symbols-data.js derives names, categories, tags, and alias search
terms from the pinned src/icons.ts metadata. Asgard action tags and display
labels were added locally. Runtime parsing accepts only svg/path elements
and the trusted collection's geometry, viewBox, fill, and opacity fields.
The secondary duotone path receives a local data-secondary marker so the
editor may apply an accent color without changing the source geometry.

Existing Asgard artwork is referenced in place from this repository:
asgard/wayfinder.webp, asgard/saga.webp, asgard/gjallarhorn.webp,
asgard/raven.webp, asgard/horn.webp, home/odin.webp, launch/emblem.webp.
These assets are not part of Phosphor and are not covered by its MIT license.
They retain the repository owner's existing rights and attribution.
They were visually reviewed before inclusion; no new artwork was generated.

